+    'v5.4.2-23 r8 (Opus B1, Codex B2). What a credit holds of its own at a money date and a recorded instant: for a credit holding a payment''s money (an overpayment credit or a reissue descended from one), its amount less its share of what was taken back as recorded (overpayment_absorbed_as_of without the cover) less what it gave; for any other credit, its remainder (customer_credit_position_as_of). Read by the escheat move, the give-back guard, enforce_escheated_credit_settled and a reissue''s size. NULL before the credit exists at the coordinates; NULL or infinite coordinates raise.';
+REVOKE ALL ON FUNCTION public.customer_credit_own_remaining_as_of(uuid, date, timestamp with time zone) FROM PUBLIC;
+GRANT EXECUTE ON FUNCTION public.customer_credit_own_remaining_as_of(uuid, date, timestamp with time zone) TO tally_app, tally_core;
 
